# Game data extracted from a WoW client. Blizzard owns it, so it is never
# committed: each install extracts its own (npm run extract:maps) or builds it
# on demand (unit models, from WOWMIN_CLIENT_DATA).
assets/instances/
assets/maps/*
!assets/maps/README.txt
assets/player-icons/
assets/models/
*.blp
*.mpq
*.MPQ

